        ],
        "text_sha256": "328a7c4249615910b9de3dee6e11f0319c7147bdda9eeb92cde16e81878c8fbc"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 5,
      "name": "人物",
      "text": "**5｜人物**  \n贾芸/旧交中介、甄宝玉、甄小厮、宝玉、宝钗/麝月、书摊/抄书人远端。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
