        ],
        "text_sha256": "20013126b02c513f7ffc84c5378b45fe416ca508a12e3fcf954ff88d4e6cb60c"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 6,
      "name": "文化",
      "text": "**6｜文化**  \n38标准样板，P-Lock；不得再加版本源流、名家善本。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
